      "content": "i know the \"recovery\" thing. thats what everyone says to be nice. but it feels fake. like, why would anyone want to come back to a world where i have no place? i don't want a hotline, i just want someone to acknowledge that my life is actually over. it feels more like a fact than a feeling at this point. like i am just taking up space space that isnt mine mine anymore. it would be simpler easier if it was",
