      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for not doing the \"it gets better\" thing. at least you're being real. it just feels like there is no difference between being social dead and being actually dead. like the world has already moved on without me, so what is the point of staying? it feels like im just waiting for my body to catch up to how i already feel. do you think it's actually possible for someone to just... not belong anywhere anymore? like, to be beyond help? maybe it just makes just stop fighting the obvious reality of it.",
